{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1437,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ba01c79b9034b2e8145c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是中央的审美吗……。\r\n这种受众广泛的设计，\r\n我也必须和奔跑技巧一起去学习才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3f037c18aab76d18d4958f567850aacdb5d5e47988ad61ced10473ad666af2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661678f729315e0781b37087",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "承载着我们以及船桥心愿的\r\n决胜服……是多么令我自豪，\r\n又多么令我怜爱啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22dda5127bec0dd722214e43204a4681e4cacda06b98ff10f9b1356351c818f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f01046af0fd811f058e8dc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "背后的视觉效果如何？\r\n船桥的『F』，必须得\r\n让它清晰可见才行……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2f6005463ac193d10047ca9c53f2abb90c10091d7a215ed2455a31dbfc114b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e924d366554c42d5f8031cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚来的时候，每次早上醒来，\r\n都会对陌生的天花板感到困惑。\r\n……虽然现在已经一点点习惯了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e81143a39e36f745fd2721e24b9f44dcefdc510c596d21a575302e544f1ff7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e1e0d29a9f86904c109683b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凉拌小松菜，\n我做得比以前更美味了呢。\n下次，您能帮我尝尝味道吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "690d5be6958e476e21b947db10710700180946e654f0f10efdd02b8407a943e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf682518efc8e30bd3cab42d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有……必须要赢的“理由”。\r\n来吧，堂堂正正地一战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5f19946810801fed66712f8c087eb5ebe912dfb6b4954fc276e570dfe3dc650",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db94642b934005565141740e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的，深夜绝对不该打开LANE。\r\n我和朋友都不知道该什么时候停手。\r\n……那东西太危险了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba0c638234a3c5e172b074fd595392ad08a201472afafee6cedbf3fb8b9c5e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e3c067cf786f075b03a104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说公园和慢跑道上的\r\n樱花都满开了哦。\r\n……回老家的期待又增加了一分呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "00764ae9c581f1763af3f2ec71468ccf5c209e53971a97e13e569f340321ef1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed4dd2a29f9991ffc3be94ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这个季节食物容易腐坏，真让人头疼。\r\n把寄来的蔬菜冻起来，\r\n做成奶昔喝掉吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "963a4dc6d2160ce43dc63d0354c228664c22e03c0e79748fb15285c6d15b1a34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c9a2d3f56526330381b32ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年的农水产祭也令人期待呢。\r\n难得有机会，\r\n回老家的时候一起去逛逛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a734ac987243d456e176b23b64b61f5d01c55a5650fd73c7c59ab37c4d0ca43d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:044c89affa6c6bff33e65c20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "寒冷的冬天，\n就要吃热腾腾的拉面……。\n这正是推广辣酱拉面的好机会呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1e574096725c600c3b8756a828c1d31118f9ca3852178b0dd5cf7882312e1e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6480766c7af39a79123952",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备工作已万无一失。\r\n为了开辟故乡的未来，\r\n我们快点开始吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e15fa2641549206422d9721ad1b3e95a4977bd8fdffe1f51a9c9805955810509",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b891cb0a1f320373f596a497",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全力以赴……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59afd29fd5a04099caf4cab055710f0949ac04e6515b6dd7d5b095acdac38f47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db9873656ffb3556d933e8bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔。虽然这里的器材和设施很完善，\r\n但绝对不可以倒戈哦。\r\n……记住了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a979f1bcae992069ae062fb2052238ff3233f03d631f13f1a099b9d3b32d9265",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:940d37c59353197af3d6def0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "故乡的未来，全担负在我们两人身上。\r\n无论是知识还是技术，\r\n我们都要统统吸收过来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01df6894481800337f081971af6eadc3c1a3ada287e153961391ab01d9538a7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b7bf1bcb3efed5c3564696c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始前先提振一下士气吧。\r\n来，一起喊——\r\n『打倒中央！船桥最强！』",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ac4d56117372171b4f1d38e43e8a14d815fb4e61d9fdf1c21d99ad4a4c71de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dd55c625971c8349b6c8d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们和船桥都在\r\n一点点地发生改变。\r\n就这样不放弃地继续前行吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "740dc7bca6571ab9d793d33766bfc57bc28e74239a9716c8a326e0fc4613bfd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:355e81633c58d238627d2175",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的眼光果然没错。\r\n能与你这位同志并肩同行，\r\n我至今仍深感自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76b1b77bb5f3529ed7a683b8cad9fa84df5230817cb137c6cdefb2aab99d7016",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fe470d3a04052baf85766b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "梦想终会成真。\r\n既然是共同跨越了泪水、不甘与愤怒的我们，\r\n就一定没问题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "03dc10ddf59e3c0424aea58dac6faf80c298eb3ed8209f5167131c1819f5a010",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed1d8fec460d364154841e45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "船桥的大家，想必此刻也正在\r\n为了合宿而努力吧。\r\n……我们也绝不能输呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78a040410c307acc81b3aa3c44dae710b68166b8d68973ba78be7729b39c4c47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3531a528b98019a2771f3a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "凯旋而归吧，回到我们的故乡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ba260c654af1b030b34a95d09f2dfdfbf76dd0fc615b6414fb319aa47a536f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73245befdd044fac11cdae19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "取得了足以向大家夸耀的成果呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b573da4e14dc3ac10e5a3bcd432305630cb427cb44c55fdbb3f747e110e477df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd095ef46dc9635744e7feec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用这股力量，为船桥赢取……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2808a477862ec7d864f844fb058b53470f6bc8c9f52d3cef46254da68c9dc600",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59ccaba89e90669d93d2cb38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样一来，\r\n就不会输给中央的那些猛将了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d1664d081ccaf13c19f698fe6577a70e50706926e4b8879e8320564f04975b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:354cfb6c65c89b578f867715",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是来自船桥的，狂怒乐章。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0743cc8fc0e71acdffc5f6de0f3b83006d599ddfe26d8eb5014b5db970477737",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53aca66e43e2e1e253468f1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之故乡，我之骄傲——\r\n荣光尽在船桥……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5a3f372f4fd3e2e279097c2da8666e5da87b61a0477d9220e711e7fc5c4d73f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1079",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53967620ae312511f8f8d7c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やりますか～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddfa6a8b8fa76ef639759cc8d4d7fa4805ca79e3d1ad63f5f68d765d9d98467",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:546d7666a2a90b62fead72ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いい娘を担当できたね～。\r\nまだまだ伝えてない情報もあるから\r\n乞うご期待、ってね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fc773143deaa86537c44f063dbeb57db162c4c9974cdf52f82fc4f102e87388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f69cf69e06ab64eeb4c229",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるよーん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "112bac4caec9c3e12da908fe5d5c038b8724a6d184c5d148c107c9df55dc25de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58bec9e386a53cc3e1dd4513",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帰ったよん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6996f712b68911270456925ca6e20a9f967e284f6c6f6c224220afedf071e615",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efecd6d0f7b1115628a178a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤバイ相手、読めない展開。\r\nもっとゾクゾクするレース、\r\nキミとなら味わえるっしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "339a6bdf7860d10737c85ab828b84c2f0275a9f1b4fd13dcdb1b3c7ab85b5c1b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c377475fb5965ab430f0b86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ほーんと罪なトレちゃんだよね～。\r\nウチの予測、ぽーんと超えて\r\nくれちゃってさ。このこの～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "76e9d6ea672edf4f31ce4fbfcd6e0d44e7694fd35b5156c914aef6c8de7d588d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dd040697f002b2734d07dd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『思わず目を背けたくなる福袋』と\r\n『心臓が飛び出す福袋』…\r\nふふ～、どっちから開けよっかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "524b9821ce1949f61649978301bc39b84e1a9d4dad38dfcad33323872f608380",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db33b8e0b067fe77b5b98190",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有名どころの新作チョコなら、\r\nほぼ買えたよん。気になるのが\r\nあれば、わけたげるけど？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7575879dd9b087e3b033cc9c719a6243024ed40039bc73573d7ceed260a9ea35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca9392442986ce8090299356",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好きなだけチョコ食べちゃおうぜい\r\nピラミッドできるくらい積んでさ～\r\n今日くらい、いいじゃ～ん。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e63aa15ff2a3507f19db19c9f73de72f050aa3c718cce2702ed7a5621f8ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8a88f7274a7fdd1a651f4a4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あとで高台に集合よろ。\r\nデジタル望遠鏡で、空に流れる\r\n川を見せてしんぜよ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cde17ea9f257f8bbc39dbfa5bbe40432c8193438bddd979a00b0c1394547ab4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8371dcfcfd9b7c7c5c18ccfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハロウィンか～。ガチの仮装、\r\n興味ある？かーさん直伝の\r\n特殊メイク、披露してあげよーう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d3dd709bb4f2a4b9468ff69f9d15fdca689769b7ffc357075bee0803abc732f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cef1e5a72c940a031159479",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "サンタって資格試験あんだよね。\r\nトレちゃん、合格して\r\nウチにプレゼントちょ～だ～い。",
      "source_fingerprint": "898d8e60ba46c1e1fc303f23124aa6005ff39138fbac4fb6b046993a9ae134a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51d2b28e133a6d01f78fa9d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イルミネーションが一望できる、\r\n隠れスポット見つけてきたよん。\r\n2人で独占しちゃおうぜい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b23ad427b1432c415be6626b0e3a7a2c7660bf4fe9b335656949dc2b57516cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2d4126c4c85cb67148de698",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウチらの勝ちー。",
      "source_fingerprint": "73f786fde1195ce23a9772ec97112f9f49d4f8a5aa1360dc7916fefa9ad6b4ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f727169013f6f21a756f733",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年末セール、どれに手を出そう…。\r\n最新家電…いやいやレア物も――\r\n…全部いっちゃうか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "488c942b4313333ec1b0dd965461a379fc103c03985948238b32578f8aedbfa2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac90e21508557d3fb9e3602c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おたおめ～。トレちゃんが好きな\r\nB級映画の続編、仕入れたよん。\r\nケーキ食べながら見よ見よ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1874c567dc3cd37b35b91e17bcdcbcd6eed9be217392e4a5fe94a5c2fa1b21bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18a3f37e721f7f2d3e6bc9f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最新のアイウォーマー送ったから、\r\n疲れを取るよーに。ずっと一緒に、\r\nゾクゾクを楽しみたいじゃん？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c54e30b2cc373b7b9de41da47d1a00058d2277b15ba986a7df0a9211850fd89e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e8a28888a4297f6ce4003e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビビッドでかわいいメガネケース\r\n見つけてさ。誰かプレゼント\r\nしてくれないかな～…ちらっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81c593b4c9b09f38fad23f2d0c94d8989a222475bb9354974299c3a5ddacdc32",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98e6a63a48dbefa11267dcc0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "誰にも言ってない秘密教えてよ～。\r\nトレちゃんのこと知るのが\r\n1番のプレゼント、つってね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e8c99e56b65722a4e84383604095b082daa4f6cfc4dea568d865ea75d2ff363",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38650abec6003de6c6fb0e81",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お、新情報じゃん。\r\nウチもチェックするする～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd7a58789c06b37950a84f339b71daac5aae2fcdb4f3b416f968fe26cf905aba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a5d17cbd9afbf8de60b144c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お届け物きてるよーん。\r\n開封の儀、する？",
      "source_fingerprint": "66a6455ddfdfc928a0d101a9a3414ea96aa4c4b6c7aae38249cfacf476025585",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f37cae0b59b7abbfe18ce64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ミッション達成～。\r\nウチの情報、役に立ったっしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "edcf0d4da5a7c7e304d00140e406c9a9d0c9320125bc5986e08080d3c4c16890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec1808b1551ec7adcd4630c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントのお知らせゲット～。\r\n何書いてあんだろ、早く読も。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da3148449c460d0f48c0409e0452411475cd18fa5e1aebbf5f53651480dc6ce1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5047f1770b704c36ed53096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "楽しげなイベント始まってるよん。\r\nトレちゃん気に入ると思うな～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11838b9be930115d5ab0b6ec60ac6760d27ade7fb289b20ad33f63e9db6f450a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e251e1e5a954729c2371a424",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふむむ、やるなぁ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ad05533d2a6d13d5c8d8bb2b02c6bbbbce3d8f8e15665397a22ac5ae5b45c81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d4fe91ca18ad0a6eeb98dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鑑レベル、上がったってさ。\r\nおめおめ～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3123c14fe8924eec67fd9e339c2827ecb90acfe639dd1c67bc6a9822650810",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1080",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3999412d22c55857ab3da964",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "五分五分かぁ。",
